  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_header.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"686\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Big Lost City 是一个全新的结构模组，部分灵感来源于《The Lost City》，但在本模组中，这些结构将默认在世界中生成。当然，所有结构都是从零开始创建的，并且该模组完全兼容任何其他结构模组。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_description.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我们创建这个模组的初衷是让它能够融入任何末日主题的整合包中。正如你在下面的视频中看到的那样，它添加了各种现代结构，但都因岁月流逝而变得完全废弃。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">其中一些建筑的设计灵感来源于由 tsunami 制作的地图。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-Xh736Ry5oQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_screenshots.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/90/big-lost-city-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/103/big-lost-city-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/114/big-lost-city-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>准备好在最佳主机服务上与好友一起游戏了吗？</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_promo.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=